= RDF test data: N-Triples (.nt)

N-Triples serialization samples. Mix of W3C N-Triples test suite files,
real-world DBpedia and W3C-ORG ontology data, an EasyRdf FOAF fixture, and one
synthetic project fixture.

ddot.it/this ..format.. format:n-triples
ddot.it/this ..content.. N-Triples documents: W3C syntax/value tests plus collected real-world data and one synthetic fixture

# DBpedia
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..format.. format:n-triples
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Berlin serialized as N-Triples
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..depicts.. the German capital Berlin (DBpedia resource)
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..tests.. real-world data, language-tagged and typed literals, many IRIs
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-berlin.nt ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 and GNU FDL

# EasyRdf
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..kind.. collected
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..format.. format:n-triples
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..content.. FOAF example from the EasyRdf test fixtures serialized as N-Triples
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..tests.. FOAF vocabulary, person/profile triples
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..source url.. https://github.com/easyrdf/easyrdf
easyrdf-foaf.nt ..license.. BSD-3-Clause

# Synthetic project fixture
sp-multi-literal.nt ..kind.. synthetic
sp-multi-literal.nt ..format.. format:n-triples
sp-multi-literal.nt ..content.. same subject+predicate (dcterms:created/modified on org#) repeated with multiple date-typed object literals
sp-multi-literal.nt ..tests.. multiple object literals for one subject-predicate pair, xsd:date typed literals
sp-multi-literal.nt ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
sp-multi-literal.nt ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

# W3C ORG ontology excerpt (de-anonymized N-Triples), collected
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..kind.. collected
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..format.. format:n-triples
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..content.. excerpt of the W3C Core Organization (ORG) ontology in N-Triples with blank nodes named/de-anonymized
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..tests.. de-anonymized blank nodes, multilingual rdfs:label values
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..source url.. https://www.w3.org/ns/org
w3c-org-deanon.nt ..license.. W3C Software and Document License

